    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your biotic field rides every blow you land up close. Your <strong>melee Strikes</strong>, with a melee weapon or your Biotic Attack, deal an extra <strong>1d6 force</strong> damage.</p><p><strong>Heightened (+4)</strong> The extra damage increases by 1d6: <strong>2d6</strong> at 5th level, <strong>3d6</strong> at 9th, <strong>4d6</strong> at 13th, and <strong>5d6</strong> at 17th.</p><p><em>A Vanguard who fights with a shotgun keeps pace through better shotguns instead.</em></p><p><em>Classes: Vanguard.</em></p>"
